    <string name="info_action">About this screen</string>
    <string name="info_home">Home\n\nLight control: turn the app\'s light control on or off and set brightness.\n\nColor preview: shows the color and effect that are being sent to the real light.\n\nRing mode: choose whether the light is always on, on only when the phone is face down, or off.\n\nAlways-on effect: the effect that plays when there is no notification and no lock.\n\nLock color: shows the chosen color in place of all notifications until the lock is turned off.</string>
    <string name="info_settings">Settings\n\nLanguage: choose the app language. System default follows the device language.\n\nPermission status: shows whether the permissions the app needs are granted. If any are missing, some lights will not work.</string>
